% What lesson 10's chain-with-a-shortcut should say before anything is
% deleted.  A fact must be derived; `:- fact.` must never be.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/dred-graph.dl --expect programs/dred-graph.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/dred-graph.dl --expect programs/dred-graph.expect

path(n1, n5).            % end to end
path(n2, n4).            % the shortcut
:- path(n5, n1).         % edges have a direction
:- path(X, X).           % and there is no cycle
